--- Computation 2: complex conjugation with golden coefficients, at both real places of Q(sqrt5) ---
place sqrt5->+sqrt5, h=diag(phi,1,-1,-1): Hermitian signature (2, 2): real 6D ambient signature (2, 4) -> Lorentzian spacetime (3,1)
place sqrt5->-sqrt5, h=diag(psi,1,-1,-1): Hermitian signature (1, 3): J^2 = -0.618 < 0 -> quaternionic, no real points (Euclidean-type twistor structure)
place +, h=off-diagonal (phi,1): Hermitian signature (2, 2): real 6D ambient signature (2, 4) -> Lorentzian spacetime (3,1)
place -, h=off-diagonal (psi,1): Hermitian signature (2, 2): real 6D ambient signature (2, 4) -> Lorentzian spacetime (3,1)
